# What never needs to reach Vercel.
#
# Deliberately does NOT list node_modules: `vercel build` traces individual files out of it into
# the prebuilt serverless functions, and excluding it makes the deploy fail with ENOENT. The
# upload list is computed from the build output, so this costs nothing in size.
.git
.turbo
coverage
*.log
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
docs/specs/backend-apis.env
